WEBVTT

00:46.420 --> 00:47.710
<b>This one...</b>

00:48.420 --> 00:49.710
<b>He's good.</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:52.920
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:56.720
<b>Are you aware
that I'm Heizo of Arson Theft Control?</b>

00:57.890 --> 00:59.720
<b>Chief!</b>

01:07.690 --> 01:08.980
<b>The smell of makeup?</b>

01:10.820 --> 01:12.570
<b>A woman?</b>

02:14.920 --> 02:19.430
<b>The Evil Scent of Hakubaiko</b>

02:20.430 --> 02:21.680
<b>Is it true?</b>

02:21.850 --> 02:23.810
<b>Are you injured, Father?</b>

02:25.140 --> 02:26.640
<b>That's an exaggeration.</b>

02:26.850 --> 02:29.060
<b>As you can see, it's just a scrape.</b>

02:29.230 --> 02:30.480
<b>What...?</b>

02:30.690 --> 02:33.440
<b>It's not something to laugh about.</b>

02:35.280 --> 02:39.320
<b>However,
the enemy did try to kill you.</b>

02:39.530 --> 02:41.950
<b>Who can it be?</b>

02:42.160 --> 02:43.530
<b>I don't know.</b>

02:43.740 --> 02:46.540
<b>Their face was covered,</b>

02:47.250 --> 02:49.710
<b>but I did smell makeup.</b>

02:50.210 --> 02:51.790
<b>So the criminal is a woman?</b>

02:52.000 --> 02:57.550
<b>It can't be. Their slashing attacks
were far too aggressive.</b>

02:57.760 --> 03:00.010
<b>Then a man who wears makeup?</b>

03:00.550 --> 03:04.430
<b>In any case, that scent is our only clue.</b>

03:22.870 --> 03:25.780
<b>As expected, Onihei was strong.</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:30.620
<b>But</b>

03:31.330 --> 03:33.000
<b>I'll kill him next time.</b>

03:39.970 --> 03:43.430
<b>That ronin, Hanshiro.
How long are you letting him stay?</b>

03:43.640 --> 03:45.100
<b>It's been three years.</b>

03:45.300 --> 03:46.680
<b>He gives me the creeps!</b>

03:46.890 --> 03:48.470
<b>Have some compassion.</b>

03:48.680 --> 03:53.400
<b>He's been searching for his father's killer
for 20 years now.</b>

03:53.600 --> 03:55.060
<b>In the world of samurai,</b>

03:55.270 --> 03:59.490
<b>you're not fully qualified until you retaliate.</b>

03:59.690 --> 04:01.320
<b>Retaliation, eh?</b>

04:01.530 --> 04:04.160
<b>Well, he's good about paying the rent.</b>

04:04.370 --> 04:06.950
<b>We'll kick him out when he doesn't.</b>

04:08.740 --> 04:10.040
<b>Excuse me.</b>

04:10.250 --> 04:11.790
<b>Osaki, it's you.</b>

04:11.960 --> 04:13.210
<b>You startled me.</b>

04:13.370 --> 04:15.130
<b>How long were you standing there?</b>

04:16.040 --> 04:18.880
<b>Breakfast is ready.</b>

04:19.090 --> 04:23.010
<b>I can never tell if you're there or not.</b>

04:23.220 --> 04:27.140
<b>It's depressing
looking at your gloomy face.</b>

04:33.060 --> 04:35.850
<b>Restaurant Kuginukiya</b>

04:36.060 --> 04:39.360
<b>You failed your mission last night,
Mr. Kaneko.</b>

04:40.190 --> 04:41.740
<b>When I went after him,</b>

04:41.940 --> 04:44.280
<b>he ran without even looking back.</b>

04:44.490 --> 04:48.160
<b>No matter how great you are,
one would usually turn around.</b>

04:48.370 --> 04:51.120
<b>I was relying on that moment to strike.</b>

04:51.950 --> 04:54.500
<b>But he didn't allow that to happen.</b>

04:54.710 --> 04:56.790
<b>Onihei is strong.</b>

04:57.000 --> 05:01.380
<b>He's the strongest out of all the targets
you've ever assigned me.</b>

05:02.050 --> 05:04.720
<b>Are you saying that 150 ryo isn't enough?</b>

05:05.340 --> 05:07.300
<b>Three hundred ryo.</b>

05:07.890 --> 05:09.140
<b>Approved.</b>

05:09.560 --> 05:12.350
<b>Money is no object for this client.</b>

05:13.350 --> 05:17.770
<b>Will you tell me who this client is?</b>

05:18.400 --> 05:21.440
<b>That's unnecessary for you to know.</b>

05:21.650 --> 05:23.070
<b>Also,</b>

05:23.280 --> 05:27.740
<b>I request that you do not ask
for another raise, Mr. Kaneko.</b>

05:27.950 --> 05:30.030
<b>Even if the client is willing to pay,</b>

05:30.240 --> 05:32.580
<b>300 ryo is absurd.</b>

05:32.790 --> 05:34.040
<b>In this day and age,</b>

05:34.250 --> 05:38.080
<b>you can be replaced very easily.</b>

05:39.420 --> 05:41.090
<b>Also, Mr. Kaneko.</b>

05:41.300 --> 05:43.670
<b>I've been meaning to ask.</b>

05:44.420 --> 05:48.180
<b>You always smell very pleasant.</b>

05:48.390 --> 05:51.350
<b>-Do you carry a sachet?
-The smell of blood.</b>

05:52.010 --> 05:54.220
<b>It's to mask the smell of blood.</b>

05:57.100 --> 05:59.520
<b>How many lives have you taken?</b>

05:59.730 --> 06:01.940
<b>I've lost count.</b>

06:03.110 --> 06:06.320
<b>Inn of Ishikawa, Fukagawa
Tsuruya</b>

06:07.910 --> 06:09.660
<b>Excuse me.</b>

06:10.410 --> 06:12.160
<b>Is the chief here?</b>

06:12.660 --> 06:14.080
<b>You're back.</b>

06:14.290 --> 06:15.700
<b>Yes.</b>

06:16.370 --> 06:18.790
<b>He's been in Edo for three years now.</b>

06:19.000 --> 06:21.840
<b>Based on the scent of makeup
and remarkable abilities,</b>

06:22.000 --> 06:25.130
<b>I discovered that he's very well recognized
in the industry.</b>

06:26.130 --> 06:28.300
<b>-What is his name?
-Well...</b>

06:28.680 --> 06:33.260
<b>Nobody knows his real name and face.</b>

06:33.760 --> 06:35.020
<b>They say</b>

06:35.180 --> 06:38.940
<b>that he's killed every one
of his targets so far.</b>

06:39.140 --> 06:40.980
<b>Chief...</b>

06:41.520 --> 06:43.070
<b>Not to worry.</b>

06:43.270 --> 06:45.690
<b>Who do you think I am?</b>

06:45.900 --> 06:48.490
<b>I'm Heizo "the Oni."</b>

06:58.000 --> 06:59.250
<b>Thanks again</b>

07:00.040 --> 07:02.630
<b>for providing this space for me.</b>

07:02.840 --> 07:04.340
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:04.800 --> 07:06.800
<b>We're glad to be of your service.</b>

07:07.010 --> 07:09.090
<b>Please come by as much as you'd like.</b>

07:09.800 --> 07:11.840
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:13.100 --> 07:14.850
<b>I truly appreciate it.</b>

07:19.430 --> 07:21.600
<b>It's raining.</b>

08:00.060 --> 08:01.310
<b>Chief!</b>

08:04.350 --> 08:05.770
<b>Kumehachi.</b>

08:05.980 --> 08:08.780
<b>I thought I sensed his presence
when I was leaving.</b>

08:09.360 --> 08:13.860
<b>I came back
because I had this bad feeling.</b>

08:19.120 --> 08:22.250
<b>I owe you a big one for this.</b>

08:23.330 --> 08:25.080
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

08:25.290 --> 08:29.380
<b>I owe you my life, chief.</b>

08:50.900 --> 08:52.400
<b>Can't get it off!</b>

08:52.610 --> 08:55.160
<b>The blood, I can still smell the blood!</b>

09:27.020 --> 09:28.400
<b>I don't want that.</b>

09:28.730 --> 09:31.360
<b>Take that and get out.</b>

09:33.610 --> 09:35.650
<b>Confectionary Shop: Oumiya</b>

09:37.070 --> 09:39.660
<b>Is it a gift for your wife?</b>

09:39.870 --> 09:42.910
<b>I've been causing
her great anxiety lately.</b>

09:43.120 --> 09:44.410
<b>Here you go.</b>

09:46.370 --> 09:48.330
<b>Thanks again.</b>

09:51.630 --> 09:53.170
<b>Ma'am.</b>

09:53.510 --> 09:56.090
<b>What's the name of the oil
you put in your hair?</b>

09:56.260 --> 09:58.050
<b>It smells wonderful.</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:01.810
<b>My, was it too strong?</b>

10:02.010 --> 10:03.970
<b>Not at all.</b>

10:04.180 --> 10:06.560
<b>I was just curious.</b>

10:06.770 --> 10:10.150
<b>They just started carrying it at Naniwaya
in Nakamachi.</b>

10:13.860 --> 10:15.900
<b>It's this smell.</b>

10:16.860 --> 10:20.370
<b>It's called Hakubaiko.</b>

10:23.160 --> 10:27.210
<b>Ikenohata, Nakamachi
Vicinity of Naniwaya</b>

10:27.410 --> 10:30.710
<b>Do you really think he'll show up?</b>

10:30.920 --> 10:32.500
<b>According to the owner,</b>

10:32.710 --> 10:36.300
<b>every three months, a ronin appears</b>

10:36.550 --> 10:39.550
<b>to purchase their Hakubaiko.</b>

10:39.760 --> 10:42.470
<b>It's been about three months
since he was last seen,</b>

10:42.680 --> 10:44.470
<b>he can show up any minute now.</b>

10:46.480 --> 10:49.480
<b>We'll just have to trust his word.</b>

10:59.030 --> 11:02.370
<b>Don't waste time warming up food for him.</b>

11:02.950 --> 11:05.620
<b>There's no need for you
to take care of that ronin.</b>

11:06.290 --> 11:08.790
<b>You know that.</b>

11:12.540 --> 11:14.420
<b>You're an idiot.</b>

11:14.880 --> 11:17.920
<b>You were scolded for taking care of me.</b>

11:40.530 --> 11:43.070
<b>So when is he going to show up?</b>

12:28.290 --> 12:31.500
<b>How useless can you be?</b>

12:32.120 --> 12:35.500
<b>It's because your dead mother
never disciplined you.</b>

12:35.960 --> 12:38.920
<b>If you don't want to be here,
you can quit right now.</b>

12:39.500 --> 12:42.260
<b>There are plenty of replacements
out there.</b>

13:08.740 --> 13:10.620
<b>We regret to bring you this news.</b>

13:11.160 --> 13:12.620
<b>That's all right.</b>

13:12.950 --> 13:16.120
<b>Because of your efforts,
we now know his face.</b>

13:17.630 --> 13:20.500
<b>It's just a matter of time
before he's captured.</b>

13:22.710 --> 13:24.260
<b>Description of Criminal</b>

13:46.240 --> 13:47.950
<b>Osaki.</b>

13:48.780 --> 13:50.030
<b>Thanks a lot.</b>

13:53.040 --> 13:54.830
<b>I was 18 years old</b>

13:55.040 --> 13:57.210
<b>when my father was killed.</b>

13:57.710 --> 14:00.790
<b>He was killed by Tamenosuke Mori
of the same Ozu Domain</b>

14:01.000 --> 14:05.220
<b>when they got into a dispute
at a drinking party.</b>

14:05.840 --> 14:10.430
<b>It was just an insignificant quarrel
between drunks.</b>

14:11.220 --> 14:14.470
<b>And that's how my life was set.</b>

14:15.270 --> 14:18.940
<b>I've searched all over Japan for Mori,</b>

14:19.150 --> 14:20.940
<b>but he was nowhere to be found.</b>

14:21.150 --> 14:25.490
<b>I still continued to search
even after five, 10 years.</b>

14:25.690 --> 14:27.650
<b>I will never be recognized</b>

14:27.860 --> 14:29.280
<b>as a qualified samurai</b>

14:29.490 --> 14:32.280
<b>if I don't avenge my father.</b>

14:32.660 --> 14:36.250
<b>I've assassinated people
to cover travel expenses.</b>

14:36.450 --> 14:39.290
<b>What a sorry sight.</b>

14:42.130 --> 14:43.880
<b>Let's run, Osaki.</b>

14:45.420 --> 14:47.880
<b>Let's run away where nobody knows us.</b>

14:48.680 --> 14:50.840
<b>And we'll be together.</b>

14:57.390 --> 14:58.890
<b>But we need money to escape.</b>

14:59.390 --> 15:02.480
<b>I still have one job
that needs to be finished.</b>

15:10.740 --> 15:12.740
<b>Thank you for your efforts, Kumehachi.</b>

15:13.410 --> 15:17.120
<b>He's determined to kill you
no matter what.</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:20.620
<b>I suggest that you refrain from going out.</b>

15:20.830 --> 15:23.250
<b>No, it's rather favorable for me.</b>

15:23.670 --> 15:25.000
<b>To act as bait?</b>

15:26.760 --> 15:29.050
<b>I haven't been this excited in a while.</b>

15:29.220 --> 15:30.510
<b>Chief.</b>

15:30.970 --> 15:32.510
<b>Chief, where are you going?</b>

15:33.350 --> 15:35.640
<b>Relax, I'm just going to the toilet.</b>

15:36.770 --> 15:39.680
<b>Chief and his rash decisions.</b>

15:39.890 --> 15:41.520
<b>That's not the case, Sakai.</b>

15:42.730 --> 15:45.860
<b>If he can't kill the chief,</b>

15:46.070 --> 15:48.280
<b>he might resort to other crimes</b>

15:48.650 --> 15:52.490
<b>and harm others to make money
as quickly as possible.</b>

15:53.570 --> 15:55.740
<b>The chief is trying to settle it</b>

15:55.950 --> 15:58.700
<b>while he's still the assassin's target.</b>

16:01.540 --> 16:04.170
<b>Don't worry, Osaki.</b>

16:13.180 --> 16:15.930
<b>My mother gave me this
when I was little.</b>

16:16.100 --> 16:17.350
<b>I see.</b>

16:23.480 --> 16:25.020
<b>Tomorrow morning at 6.</b>

16:25.230 --> 16:27.230
<b>Meet me at the Eitai Bridge.</b>

16:41.040 --> 16:42.290
<b>All right.</b>

16:43.120 --> 16:44.960
<b>Based on his MO,</b>

16:45.170 --> 16:48.040
<b>he'll attack at night
when there's nobody around.</b>

16:48.250 --> 16:51.010
<b>So, what now?</b>

16:53.260 --> 16:56.930
<b>One cannot fight on an empty stomach.</b>

16:57.430 --> 16:59.930
<b>Inn of Ishikawa, Fukagawa
Tsuruya</b>

17:07.810 --> 17:09.690
<b>He's late.</b>

17:10.650 --> 17:14.320
<b>No, he must suspect that I'd attack
at night and...</b>

17:17.070 --> 17:18.320
<b>Welcome.</b>

17:18.530 --> 17:21.330
<b>I need to rest, do you have a room open?</b>

17:21.540 --> 17:23.330
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

17:23.960 --> 17:26.250
<b>Please follow me to the second floor.</b>

17:34.220 --> 17:37.090
<b>Please use this room.</b>

17:51.820 --> 17:53.280
<b>You've changed.</b>

17:53.900 --> 17:55.780
<b>Your last attack</b>

17:55.990 --> 17:57.490
<b>had more weight than this.</b>

17:57.700 --> 18:00.490
<b>As if you put all your life into it.</b>

18:00.700 --> 18:02.790
<b>I don't sense that from you anymore.</b>

18:03.330 --> 18:05.910
<b>Do you now have a reason to live?</b>

18:08.370 --> 18:09.630
<b>What's the matter?</b>

18:09.960 --> 18:12.250
<b>Do you fear death?</b>

18:16.510 --> 18:18.010
<b>What a joke.</b>

18:18.340 --> 18:20.180
<b>My enemy was in front of me.</b>

18:20.390 --> 18:21.760
<b>But in the end,</b>

18:21.970 --> 18:25.730
<b>I'm not even half a man.</b>

18:25.930 --> 18:29.350
<b>So it goes. I'll come up with the money
some other way.</b>

18:29.560 --> 18:33.230
<b>I just have to run away with Osaki
to a place</b>

18:33.690 --> 18:35.240
<b>where nobody knows us.</b>

18:52.250 --> 18:55.880
<b>You...? Why...?</b>

18:56.380 --> 18:58.220
<b>My true name</b>

18:58.680 --> 19:01.470
<b>is Tamenosuke Mori,
a former Ozu warrior.</b>

19:01.930 --> 19:04.470
<b>Tamenosuke Mori?</b>

19:04.680 --> 19:07.390
<b>That's right, Hanshiro Kaneko.</b>

19:07.600 --> 19:09.480
<b>I'm the enemy</b>

19:09.980 --> 19:12.150
<b>you've been searching for.</b>

19:15.610 --> 19:17.940
<b>If retaliation is part of a samurai's way,</b>

19:18.150 --> 19:20.410
<b>then killing a possible avenger is too!</b>

19:20.860 --> 19:23.740
<b>-Stop!
-Too late!</b>

19:27.450 --> 19:29.160
<b>I didn't even know</b>

19:29.370 --> 19:31.870
<b>my enemy's face.</b>

19:47.600 --> 19:50.020
<b>What should I do?</b>

19:50.230 --> 19:51.480
<b>Well,</b>

19:51.690 --> 19:54.770
<b>we don't know who he's been working for.</b>

19:54.980 --> 19:57.030
<b>You'll risk being targeted</b>

19:57.230 --> 20:00.610
<b>by those who used to hire him.</b>

20:00.820 --> 20:03.620
<b>I suggest that you stay away from Edo
for a year.</b>

20:03.780 --> 20:05.030
<b>Yes.</b>

20:05.200 --> 20:09.580
<b>Rest assured, I'll protect this inn
while you're away.</b>

20:09.790 --> 20:11.290
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

20:12.370 --> 20:14.290
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

20:15.040 --> 20:17.050
<b>It's the irony of fate.</b>

20:17.250 --> 20:19.670
<b>A man who was bound to the past</b>

20:19.880 --> 20:22.760
<b>was about to let go and live in the present</b>

20:22.970 --> 20:26.300
<b>only to be killed by the past.</b>

20:32.730 --> 20:36.520
<b>Omichi, I'm sorry for putting you through
all of this.</b>

20:36.730 --> 20:38.360
<b>What are you saying?</b>

20:38.570 --> 20:42.110
<b>We are husband and wife.</b>

20:42.360 --> 20:44.360
<b>Yes, you're right.</b>

20:50.910 --> 20:52.870
<b>Let's hurry.</b>

20:53.960 --> 20:56.040
<b>The day is breaking.</b>

21:02.720 --> 21:04.260
<b>In any case,</b>

21:04.680 --> 21:06.840
<b>even if he was an enemy,</b>

21:07.050 --> 21:10.140
<b>Hanshiro Kaneko had excellent
swordsmanship.</b>

21:10.350 --> 21:11.680
<b>If I were to die,</b>

21:11.890 --> 21:15.270
<b>I wouldn't mind being defeated by a man
like him in a duel.</b>

21:16.100 --> 21:17.650
<b>Don't make that face.</b>

21:19.860 --> 21:21.400
<b>It's only a joke.</b>

21:22.570 --> 21:26.160
<b>Chief, do you have any idea</b>

21:26.360 --> 21:28.780
<b>who the hidden hand who hired him
could be?</b>

21:28.990 --> 21:31.700
<b>There are so many
that I haven't the slightest idea.</b>

21:31.870 --> 21:35.080
<b>There are a countless number
of thieves who want me dead.</b>

21:35.250 --> 21:36.920
<b>But that's...</b>

21:37.130 --> 21:41.920
<b>It's just the reality. From here on out,
there will be more assassins like him.</b>

21:42.130 --> 21:44.170
<b>Not to worry, Father!</b>

21:44.670 --> 21:46.720
<b>If you were to get assassinated,</b>

21:46.930 --> 21:49.640
<b>I'll be sure to avenge you.</b>

21:49.850 --> 21:52.680
<b>-Tatsuzo.
-You fool!</b>

21:52.890 --> 21:56.440
<b>You must protect your father
before that happens.</b>

21:56.640 --> 21:59.110
<b>And what makes you think
that you can defeat</b>

21:59.310 --> 22:01.360
<b>the enemy who killed your father?</b>

22:01.570 --> 22:03.360
<b>They'll end up killing you first!</b>

22:03.570 --> 22:05.110
<b>But I...</b>

22:05.360 --> 22:07.280
<b>Seems like I can't die anytime soon.</b>

22:07.450 --> 22:09.490
<b>Take your life a little more seriously!</b>

22:21.130 --> 22:27.300
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:33.140
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:39.100
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:44.860
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.820 --> 22:50.110
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.280 --> 22:54.120
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:59.170
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:05.130
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.960 --> 23:11.340
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.050 --> 23:14.970
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.230 --> 23:23.610
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.980 --> 23:32.990
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:42.250 --> 23:45.550
<b>Omasa, Heizo's old acquaintance,
now serves as Heizo’s spy</b>

23:46.130 --> 23:48.840
<b>Heizo finds out she is in danger</b>

23:50.050 --> 23:52.800
<b>Next episode of Onihei
"Blood Battle"</b>
